OL,3,AGoogle Cloud says services are
OL,4,Arecovering after outage hit banks,
OL,5,Abusinesses, and courts
OL,6,
OL,7,FOur live coverage has now ended - read
OL,8,Fmore in our news story
OL,10,FGoogle says only a "very small" number
OL,11,Fof customers are now affected after
OL,12,Fproblems with its Cloud service
OL,13,Faffected banks, other businesses, and
OL,14,Fcourts
OL,16,FRevolut, Halifax, HSBC, delivery
OL,17,Fservice DPD, and e-bike service Forest
OL,18,Fwere among the businesses affected
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
