OL,3,AGoogle Cloud says services are
OL,4,Arecovering after outage hit banks,
OL,5,Abusinesses, and courts
OL,6,
OL,7,FElsewhere, the courts service said its
OL,8,Fvideo links were affected - the
OL,9,FCriminal Bar Association said earlier
OL,10,Fthat prosecution and defence barristers
OL,11,Fin England and Wales could not "proceed
OL,12,Fwith trials and other hearings"
OL,14,FGoogle says the problem was caused by a
OL,15,F"power event" at a London data centre
